    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/8718e9bcdf36e9c879cfeff30f08e161.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=616 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/8718e9bcdf36e9c879cfeff30f08e161.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an act of desperation and courage, Ayo finds himself separated from his mother and adrift in the ocean. Upon finding solid ground, he encounters a new and challenging land, a place full of mysteries and dangers. Face a variety of enemies, from wild animals to hostile indigenous warriors, as you explore dense forests, open fields, and dark caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The South Island is an action RPG with a nostalgic pixel art style, inspired by the exploration of Zelda (SNES) and the progression system of classic Diablo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/5b206a62ff66fe7336d84e29a05a8235.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/5b206a62ff66fe7336d84e29a05a8235.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hand-drawn maps and special areas, exploring the local fauna and flora;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the main character face unique enemies while progressing, collecting items and resources;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with native, magical, and firearm weapons: axe, spear, blowgun, bow and arrow, magic staff, and arquebus;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face epic bosses, unique entities, and 2D platform-style battles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different mechanics in each map \u2014 discover new features as you progress through the game;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique items: cook traditional native recipes and create local crafts using gathered resources;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special merchant with a full buying and selling system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, mini-games, side quests, and an engaging story about a brave young boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4165c2a88c112d3aa253d475f3e1fd95.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4165c2a88c112d3aa253d475f3e1fd95.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=229 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4693a92a15328ff0b19cbd750d25ce85.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4693a92a15328ff0b19cbd750d25ce85.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=126 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ayo overcome all challenges and rescue his mother. Face formidable enemies, solve intriguing puzzles, and explore a vibrant, lively world. Ayo's courage and determination will be tested at every step. Are you ready for this epic adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=632 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.mp4?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERCHANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where he comes from... only that he has everything you need. Buy and sell with the wandering merchant before he vanishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/fbf18a2f4fc16114bca120e55e8314e2.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/fbf18a2f4fc16114bca120e55e8314e2.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=190 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00d3GA MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Ayo's Refuge House, created as a sanctuary for the player to rest, fish, collect new resources, craft exclusive foods, and unique handcrafted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=758 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.mp4?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/d49c32c6cb88c069ea58f494809d9fe2.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/d49c32c6cb88c069ea58f494809d9fe2.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=229 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/8718e9bcdf36e9c879cfeff30f08e161.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=616 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/8718e9bcdf36e9c879cfeff30f08e161.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an act of desperation and courage, Ayo finds himself separated from his mother and adrift in the ocean. Upon finding solid ground, he encounters a new and challenging land, a place full of mysteries and dangers. Face a variety of enemies, from wild animals to hostile indigenous warriors, as you explore dense forests, open fields, and dark caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The South Island is an action RPG with a nostalgic pixel art style, inspired by the exploration of Zelda (SNES) and the progression system of classic Diablo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/5b206a62ff66fe7336d84e29a05a8235.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/5b206a62ff66fe7336d84e29a05a8235.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hand-drawn maps and special areas, exploring the local fauna and flora;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the main character face unique enemies while progressing, collecting items and resources;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with native, magical, and firearm weapons: axe, spear, blowgun, bow and arrow, magic staff, and arquebus;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face epic bosses, unique entities, and 2D platform-style battles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different mechanics in each map \u2014 discover new features as you progress through the game;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique items: cook traditional native recipes and create local crafts using gathered resources;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special merchant with a full buying and selling system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, mini-games, side quests, and an engaging story about a brave young boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4165c2a88c112d3aa253d475f3e1fd95.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4165c2a88c112d3aa253d475f3e1fd95.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=229 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4693a92a15328ff0b19cbd750d25ce85.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/4693a92a15328ff0b19cbd750d25ce85.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=126 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ayo overcome all challenges and rescue his mother. Face formidable enemies, solve intriguing puzzles, and explore a vibrant, lively world. Ayo's courage and determination will be tested at every step. Are you ready for this epic adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=632 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/14fecb22327ab4e39e04bf4bb756701e.mp4?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERCHANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where he comes from... only that he has everything you need. Buy and sell with the wandering merchant before he vanishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/fbf18a2f4fc16114bca120e55e8314e2.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/fbf18a2f4fc16114bca120e55e8314e2.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=190 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00d3GA MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Ayo's Refuge House, created as a sanctuary for the player to rest, fish, collect new resources, craft exclusive foods, and unique handcrafted items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" width=758 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.webm?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/9c98e1837ab2c390102b36fc32037b9e.mp4?t=1754311011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/d49c32c6cb88c069ea58f494809d9fe2.poster.avif?t=1754311011\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000020/extras/d49c32c6cb88c069ea58f494809d9fe2.apng?t=1754311011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=229 /></picture></span></p>",
